s gracious and full of compassion.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ט) He hath given meat unto them that fear him:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(י) He will ever be mindful of his covenant.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(כ) He hath shewed his people the power of his works,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ל) That he may give them the heritage of the heathen.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(מ) The works of his hands are verity and judgment;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(נ) All his commandments are sure.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ס) They stand fast for ever and ever,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ע) And are done in truth and uprightness.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(פ) He sent redemption unto his people:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(צ) He hath commanded his covenant for ever:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ק) Holy and reverend is his name.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ר) The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ש) A good understanding have all they that do his commandments:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ת) His praise endureth for ever.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/111.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/112.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/110.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}